        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-06-26T15:33:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The new config option will be available automatically if we start using the CHIP_FAMILY and CHIP_VARIANT in the build.mk files\n\nSee https://chromium.git.corp.google.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/master/board/grunt/build.mk#10 for an example. The value for CHIP_FAMILY automatically turns into defines that we can use in code like this.\n\nWe don\u0027t want to load up all of the older devices with code that doesn\u0027t make sense.",
      "parentUuid": "6cbce42d_f527bfb1",
